{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《璀璨之城》陳瀅「剥光豬」色誘張智霖一幕，因尺度極之大膽，引起網上極大熱議，有些更揚言要作出投訴，而廣管局今（16日)回覆截至昨日為止，共接獲２８宗投訴，當中25宗涉及昨晚(15日)播出的集數，現正按既定程序處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:39:40.513680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T13:37:38.443228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:37:38.443228+00:00","content_hash":"9d03c82b5f21a0e8609b52981b1cd6b5c6c0888e7eb7899873dfb2d653c64541","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}